&lt;li&gt;Support the enablement of customer teams across roles, responsibilities and process that&amp;nbsp; facilitate the customer’s optimised content supply chain.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually grow your footprint and role within the client engagement and relationship.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
